course: dictionary
lesson: 10233
title: Your toenails
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A toenail is the hard, thin, flat covering on the top of the end of each toe. It is like a fingernail, but it grows on your foot.
explain: Toenails keep growing, but more slowly than fingernails, so they need cutting. «Toenails straight across» is the right way to cut them, with nail clippers or by an adult.
explain: If a toenail is cut too short or curved, its edge can grow into the skin. This is called an ingrown toenail. «A sore, red, swollen toe beside the nail may be an ingrown toenail, so you tell a parent.»
fact: A toenail is the hard, thin, flat covering on the end of each toe.
fact: Toenails are made of keratin, the same tough stuff as hair and fingernails.
fact: Toenails grow more slowly than fingernails, so they need cutting from time to time.
fact: «Toenails cut too short or curved can grow into the skin.» This is an ingrown toenail.
fact: Keep your feet clean and dry, and tell a grown-up if a toe looks sore or red.
exercise: «Cutting toenails straight across helps stop ingrown toenails.» How should toenails be cut? | As short as possible | Curved to match the toe | *Straight across | Only when they fall off
exercise: «A sore, red, swollen toe beside the nail may be an ingrown toenail.» What should you do? | Hide it and say nothing | Paint over it | *Tell a parent | Cut the nail very short
exercise: What is a toenail? | A bone inside your toe | A type of sock | A soft pad under your foot | *The hard, thin, flat covering on the top of the end of each toe
test: What is an ingrown toenail? | A toenail that falls off | *A toenail edge that grows into the skin | A toenail that is painted | A toenail that grows faster than a fingernail
test: Toenails and fingernails are both made of which tough stuff? | Wool | Water | Bone | *Keratin
exam: Why do toenails need cutting? | *Because they keep growing, though more slowly than fingernails | Because they turn into bone | Because they stop growing for ever | Because cutting makes them grow faster
